            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "If a fill, true when the execution belongs to a block trade (a large,\nprivately negotiated trade executed away from the order book). Lets\ndrop-copy consumers recognize block fills directly instead of joining\nto the trade via trade_id or misreading them as order-book activity."
          }
        },
        "description": "Execution denotes a state change for an order in the exchange."
      },
